{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51608","headline":"谢新恩（六首） 五 · 李煜","name":"谢新恩（六首） 五","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"樱花落尽春将困，秋千架下归时。\n漏暗（疑作「满阶」）斜月迟迟，花在枝。\n（缺二十字）彻晓纱窗下，待来君不知。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李煜","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51608.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51608","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}